#: rc.cpp:55
msgid "Your Certificate is Ready to Be Sent"
msgstr "A seu Certificado está Listo para o Envío"

#: rc.cpp:56
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"Your signature key pair is now ready to be sent to the CA (certification "
"authority) which will generate a certificate for you and send it back via "
"email. Please review the certificate shown below. You should also write down "
"the checksum so that you can match it against the certificate sent back by "
"the CA.\n"
"<p>\n"
"If you want to change anything, press Back and make your changes. Otherwise "
"press Finish to send the signature key pair to the CA.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"O seu par de chaves de asinar están listas para enviarse á CA (Autoridade "
"do Certificado) que xerará un certificado para vostede e llo enviará por "
"correo electrónico. Por favor, revise o certificado amosado embaixo. "
