#: rc.cpp:98
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Always Check Certificate Path To Root Certificate</h1>\n"
"If this option is turned on, the certificate path belonging to the "
"receiver's certificate will always be checked all the way to the root "
"certificate.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Comprobar Sempre a Ruta do Certificado Ó Certificado Root</h1>\n"
"Se se activa esta opción, a ruta do certificado pertencente ó certificado "
"do destinatario comprobarase sempre durante todo o camiño ó certificado de "
"root.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:99
msgid "Check certificate &path"
msgstr "Com&probar ruta ó certificado "

#: rc.cpp:100
msgid "Check here to have the whole certificate path checked"
msgstr "Active isto para ter a ruta completa ó certificado comprobada"

#: rc.cpp:101
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Check Certificate Path</h1>\n"
"If this option is turned on, the whole path of the receiver's certificate up "
"to the root will be checked.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Note that it is not possible to turn off checking the receiver's certificate "
"itself.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Comprobar Ruta ó Certificado</h1>\n"
"Se se activa esta opción, a ruta completa ó certificado do receptor será "
"comprobada.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Note que non é posible  desactivar a comprobación do certificado do "
"receptor en sí mesmo.\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:103
msgid "&Use certificate revocation lists (CRLs)"
msgstr "&Usar listas de certificados revocados (CRLs)"

#: rc.cpp:104
msgid "Check to use CRLs"
msgstr "Activar para empregar CRLs"

#: rc.cpp:105
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Use Certificate Revocation Lists (CRLs)</h1>\n"
"A certificate revocation list contains certificates that have been withdrawn "
"and should not be used for encryption purposes any longer. A user may wish "
"to have his or her certificate revoked because he or she suspects that the "
"certificate's integrity has been compromised (e.g. somebody has guessed the "
"PIN).\n"
"<p>\n"
"It is recommended to use CRLs for maximum security. In the configuration "
"dialog for certificate and CRL management, you can select where to retrieve "
"the CRLs from.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Empregar Listas de Revocación de Certificados(CRLs)</h1>\n"
"Unha lista de revocación de certificados contén certificados baixo "
"sospeita que non se deberían empregar nunca máis para propósitos de "
"cifraxe. Un usuario podería desexar ter os seus certificados revocados "
"porque el ou ela sospeita que a integridade do certificado podería estar "
"comprometida (p.e. alguén que puidera ter descuberto o PIN).\n"
"<p>\n"
"Recoméndase empregar as CRLs para unha seguridade máxima. No diálogo de "
"configuración para a xestión de certificados e CRLs, vostede pode "
"seleccionar dende ónde obter as CRLs.\n"
"</qt> "

