"<h1>Warn If CRL Expires In The Near Future</h1>\n"
"In this field you can specify how soon before a CRL expires you are warned "
"about this expiry.\n"
"<p>\n"
"The recommended setting for the SPHINX environment is 7 days.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Advertir Se CRL Caduca Nun Futuro Próximo</h1>\n"
"Neste campo pode especificar o número de días antes nos que se debe "
"producir a advertencia.\n"
